@startuml UC-25
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-25.md
title UC-25: View Wishlist
footer Feature WISH-03 | Business rules: BR-08, BR-10, BR-14
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "WishlistController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "WishlistService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open wishlist
MVC -> API : GET /api/wishlist
API -> SVC : GetAsync(currentUserId)
SVC -> DB : Select Wishlists JOIN Products\nWHERE UserId = current user ORDER BY CreatedAt DESC (BR-08)
DB --> SVC : Rows
SVC -> SVC : Effective price (BR-14)\nIsAvailable = Product.IsActive (BR-10)
SVC --> API : WishlistItemDto[]
API --> MVC : 200 OK
MVC --> U : Show saved products;\nhidden products shown as unavailable

@enduml
